# Raw traces are large (~1.5 GB per full run) and are stored externally,
# referenced from the run manifest by URL + SHA-256. Only derived metrics under
# results/ are committed. See README.md and RUN_MANIFEST_SCHEMA.md.
traces/*.json
traces/*.json.gz
traces/*.nsys-rep
traces/*.ncu-rep

# Model weights must never be committed.
*.pt
*.safetensors

__pycache__/
